NOTICE OF MODIFICATION

This is a modified version of the original project:
https://github.com/wx-minapp/minapp-vscode

Modifications include:
- Dynamic property parsing with TypeScript AST
- Smart space completion with context detection
- Template expression variable completion
- Enhanced documentation and configuration guide

For a complete list of changes, see CHANGELOG.md